"Built on the Chromium Embedded Framework. Karere 4.0 replaces the WebKitGTK "
"backend with the Chromium Embedded Framework, bringing full video attachment "
"playback (H.264/AAC), multi-account support with isolated sessions, per-"
"account zoom, and a faster, more compatible rendering engine while keeping "
"the same native GTK4/libadwaita shell."
msgstr ""
"Zdaj zgrajeno na CEF/Chromium 148. Karere 4.0 nadomešča zaledje WebKitGTK s "
"Chromium Embedded Framework ter prinaša polno predvajanje video prilog "
"(H.264/AAC), podporo za več računov z izoliranimi sejami, povečavo na "
"posamezni račun in hitrejši, bolj združljiv pogon za izrisovanje, hkrati pa "
"ohranja isto domorodno lupino GTK4/libadwaita."

